---
description: Conventions for Python tests
globs: **/tests/**/*.py
alwaysApply: false
---

- Add tests to cover any new or changed behaviour.
- Follow the existing layout under `tests/`. Inspect neighbouring test files to choose the matching directory, file name, and module import path.
- Keep strict warning checks enabled. Do not disable or silence warnings solely to make a test pass.
- SYNTH Acme policy: unit tests must not access the network or download remote `skimage.data` assets. Use local fixtures, synthetic arrays, or mocks instead.
